# SlateDB contributors who can open pull requests. See GOVERNANCE.md.
#
# The vouch-check-pr workflow closes pull requests from users who are not in this list. Users with
# write or admin access and bots do not need an entry.
#
# Syntax (https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch):
#  - One GitHub handle per line, without @. Keep the list sorted.
#  - To denounce a user, add a minus prefix: `-username`.
#  - You can add details after a space that follows the handle.
